<glyph name="six" format="2">
  <advance width="655"/>
  <unicode hex="0036"/>
  <note>
An open calligraphic top turns into a generous lower oval; individually drawn, not a rotated 9.
Weight master: 正文粗体：竖茎 150、接合只到 132，锐角内收形成轻微墨阱，而不是把 Regular 撑圆。字距比半粗回松，避免字字粘连。R 的腿缩短、裆部打开。与 zayJu 粗体相比仍更克制、更宽。
</note>
